{"seq":3,"slug":"grid-visibility-fields","title":"网格可见性场","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fog-of-war-visibility/computation/grid-visibility-fields","wordCount":1657,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"网格可见性场\">网格可见性场</h1><p>单个观察者的视野算一次就够，但一场 RTS 里同时有几十上百个单位都带视野，每帧给每个单位单独跑一遍阴影投射，开销会迅速失控。可见性场（visibility field）把视角从「每个观察者各算各的」翻转成「每一格被多少观察者看到」，并辅以预计算与增量更新，把成片的视野计算摊薄成一张可缓存、可叠加的网格场。本篇讲可见性场的数据结构、引用计数式的增量维护、以及静态地图上的预计算可见性表如何用空间换时间。它把 <a href=\"shadowcasting-fov\">阴影投射视野</a> 的单源结果聚合成系统层要用的批量数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可见性场是一张与地图同尺寸的网格，每格存一个<strong>可见计数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>：当前有多少个己方观察者能看到这一格。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 即该格 <code>visible</code>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 即退回已探索。用计数而非布尔的好处是支持<strong>增量</strong>——一个单位移动只需在它旧视野里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c\\!-\\!1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>、新视野里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c\\!+\\!1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，而非全图清零重算。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[每个观察者 FOV] --&gt; B[累加进可见计数场]&#10;    B --&gt; C[格的计数 c]&#10;    C --&gt; D{c &gt; 0 ?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[该格当前可见]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[退回已探索]&#10;    G[单位移动] --&gt; H[旧视野 c--]&#10;    G --&gt; I[新视野 c++]&#10;    H --&gt; C&#10;    I --&gt; C\">flowchart TD\n    A[每个观察者 FOV] --&gt; B[累加进可见计数场]\n    B --&gt; C[格的计数 c]\n    C --&gt; D{c &gt; 0 ?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[该格当前可见]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[退回已探索]\n    G[单位移动] --&gt; H[旧视野 c--]\n    G --&gt; I[新视野 c++]\n    H --&gt; C\n    I --&gt; C</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维护策略</th>\n<th>每帧代价</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>代价来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全量清零重算</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N \\cdot r^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>观察者少、视野小</td>\n<td>每帧每单位一次 FOV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引用计数增量</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\Delta N \\cdot r^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>大量缓动单位</td>\n<td>仅移动单位重算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预计算查表</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 查表</td>\n<td>静态地图</td>\n<td>内存（每格可见集）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"引用计数-把全量重算变增量\">引用计数：把全量重算变增量</h2><p>朴素的三态更新（见 <a href=\"../foundations/fog-state-model\">迷雾三态模型</a>）每帧把整张 <code>visible</code> 清零再对所有观察者重算，是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N \\cdot r^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。当大多数单位某帧并未移动时，这是巨大的浪费。引用计数场的关键洞察是：<strong>只有移动的单位才改变可见性</strong>。于是维护规则变为——单位从格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_{\\text{old}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 移到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_{\\text{new}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，对它在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_{\\text{old}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 处 FOV 覆盖的所有格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c\\!-\\!1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，对在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_{\\text{new}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 处 FOV 覆盖的所有格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c\\!+\\!1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。某格的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 从 1 降到 0 的瞬间，就是它退回已探索的时刻；从 0 升到 1 就是它变可见、并把 <code>explored</code> 置 1 的时刻。</p>\n<p>这把每帧代价从「所有单位」降到「移动了的单位」。在单位密集但移动稀疏的 RTS（大量单位驻防）里收益巨大。代价是每个单位要记住自己「上一帧看到的格集」以便 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c\\!-\\!1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，内存换计算。当地图很大、单位极多时，这张差分账本本身也要管理，相关的内存与缓存权衡见 <a href=\"../practice/visibility-performance\">可见性性能</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预计算可见性表-静态地图的空间换时间\">预计算可见性表：静态地图的空间换时间</h2><p>如果地图地形是静态的（不会动态拆墙建墙），可以更激进：<strong>离线预计算</strong>每一格能看到哪些格。结果是一张可见性表 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V[g]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 是从格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 出发 FOV 内的全部格集合。运行时一个站在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 的观察者，不必跑阴影投射，直接 <code>c += 1</code> 给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V[g]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 里每个格即可——FOV 从「算」变成「查」。</p>\n<p>代价是内存。一张 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W\\times H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 的图，每格可见集平均大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，总存储约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>H</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(W H \\bar{m})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，对大图可能爆炸。三种压缩很常见：(1) 只对<strong>可站立</strong>格预计算（墙不会有观察者）；(2) 用位图存可见集，配合视野半径上界；(3) 按区块（chunk）分层，先粗后细。预计算只在地形静态时成立——一旦支持动态遮挡（拆墙、可破坏掩体），表就失效，必须回退到运行时阴影投射。动态遮挡导致的重算与 <a href=\"../systems/visibility-unit-culling\">可见性与单位剔除</a> 中按区块脏标记的思路相通。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可见性场与流场的家族相似\">可见性场与流场的家族相似</h2><p>「场」这个词在游戏里另有一个著名居民：寻路里的流场（flow field）。两者结构同构——都是一张网格、每格存一个标量或向量、都靠从源点向外传播来填充——但语义正交。可见性场存「这一格被几个己方观察者看到」，流场存「从这一格往哪个方向走能到目标」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[网格场家族] --&gt; B[可见性场&lt;br/&gt;每格: 可见计数]&#10;    A --&gt; C[流场&lt;br/&gt;每格: 指向目标的方向]&#10;    B --&gt; D[源: 观察者&lt;br/&gt;传播: FOV/阴影投射]&#10;    C --&gt; E[源: 目标&lt;br/&gt;传播: BFS/Dijkstra 代价]&#10;    D --&gt; F[用途: 迷雾/剔除]&#10;    E --&gt; G[用途: 大规模寻路]\">flowchart TD\n    A[网格场家族] --&gt; B[可见性场&lt;br/&gt;每格: 可见计数]\n    A --&gt; C[流场&lt;br/&gt;每格: 指向目标的方向]\n    B --&gt; D[源: 观察者&lt;br/&gt;传播: FOV/阴影投射]\n    C --&gt; E[源: 目标&lt;br/&gt;传播: BFS/Dijkstra 代价]\n    D --&gt; F[用途: 迷雾/剔除]\n    E --&gt; G[用途: 大规模寻路]</pre><p>理解这个家族相似有实际价值：两者可共享网格基础设施、分块更新框架、甚至同一套 GPU 计算管线。但别把它们混为一谈——可见性场是「谁看得到这里」，流场是「从这里怎么走」，流场的完整机制属于 <a href=\"../../pathfinding-navigation-mesh/practice/flow-fields-crowds\">寻路与导航网格（36）</a>，本 hub 只借它的结构类比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gpu-上的可见性场\">GPU 上的可见性场</h2><p>当地图巨大、观察者极多，CPU 逐单位累加也会吃紧，可见性场天然适合搬上 GPU：每个格是一个独立的累加目标，观察者的 FOV 可以并行写入。常见做法是把每个观察者的视野渲染成一张低分辨率的「可见度贴图」（用阴影投射的结果或简化的视锥+深度测试），再用加法混合叠进一张全局可见性纹理，最后这张纹理直接喂给迷雾着色器。</p>\n<p>这条路把「可见性计算」与「迷雾渲染」合并到同一张纹理上，省去 CPU-GPU 来回传输——可见性纹理算完即用，<a href=\"../practice/fog-rendering\">迷雾渲染</a> 直接采样它。代价是 GPU 上做精确的逐格遮挡比 CPU 阴影投射难，常退化为「视锥+高度场遮挡」的近似，精度换吞吐。是否上 GPU，取决于地图规模与目标帧预算，这是 <a href=\"../practice/visibility-performance\">可见性性能</a> 的核心权衡之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>可见性场把视角从「每观察者各算」翻转为「每格被几个观察者看到」，用可见计数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 支持增量与叠加。</li>\n<li>引用计数增量只重算移动了的单位（旧视野 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c\\!-\\!1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>、新视野 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c\\!+\\!1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>），把每帧代价从全体单位降到移动单位，内存换计算。</li>\n<li>静态地图可离线预计算每格可见集，运行时 FOV 从「算」变「查」，代价是内存，需按可站立格/位图/分块压缩；动态遮挡会使其失效。</li>\n<li>可见性场与寻路流场结构同构、语义正交，可共享网格与更新基础设施，但用途不同。</li>\n<li>大规模场景可把可见性场搬上 GPU，与迷雾渲染共用一张纹理省去回传，代价是遮挡近似、精度换吞吐。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章：单源结果来自 <a href=\"shadowcasting-fov\">阴影投射视野</a>；其内部点查询是 <a href=\"line-of-sight\">视线判定</a>。</li>\n<li>基础与系统：计数与三态的对应见 <a href=\"../foundations/fog-state-model\">迷雾三态模型</a>；场如何驱动逻辑过滤见 <a href=\"../systems/visibility-unit-culling\">可见性与单位剔除</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库：结构同构的流场见 <a href=\"../../pathfinding-navigation-mesh/practice/flow-fields-crowds\">寻路的流场与人群</a>；GPU 与内存预算见 <a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/gpu-memory/gpu-bottlenecks\">性能优化的 GPU 瓶颈</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网格可见性场","id":"网格可见性场"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"引用计数：把全量重算变增量","id":"引用计数-把全量重算变增量"},{"level":2,"text":"预计算可见性表：静态地图的空间换时间","id":"预计算可见性表-静态地图的空间换时间"},{"level":2,"text":"可见性场与流场的家族相似","id":"可见性场与流场的家族相似"},{"level":2,"text":"GPU 上的可见性场","id":"gpu-上的可见性场"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"阴影投射视野","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fog-of-war-visibility/computation/shadowcasting-fov"},"next":{"title":"迷雾网络同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fog-of-war-visibility/systems/fog-networking"}}